Portions of this package (R/epiFilter.R, R/epiSmoother.R,
R/recursPredict.R) are unmodified R ports of the EpiFilter algorithm,
copyright Kris V. Parag, released under GPL-3 and used here per that
license. See:
  Parag KV. (2021) "Improved estimation of time-varying reproduction
  numbers at low case incidence and between epidemic waves."
  PLOS Computational Biology 17(9): e1009347.
  https://github.com/kpzoo/EpiFilter

R/recursPredict.R (the configurable-grid maxI version) and
R/recursPredictQuantiles.R are modified versions of the above
(Raj Subedi), extending the configurable prediction grid and quantile
levels respectively.
